{"id":"0c9c8bbe91d08547c76508d069faae942faa0c82","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230751","title":"开了 6 年的网易云 vip 不准备续费了，你们都用什么听歌软件？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"jsomin","excerpt":"问与答 - @jsomin - 最近几年都在用 Spotify ，曲库挺符合我歌单的，没开订阅，一直用重写也没有广告，目前设备是 Airpods Pro2 ，受限于苹果的 AAC 编码，开订阅的话提升大不大？ Apple Mus","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>最近几年都在用 Spotify ，曲库挺符合我歌单的，没开订阅，一直用重写也没有广告，目前设备是 Airpods Pro2 ，受限于苹果的 AAC 编码，开订阅的话提升大不大？<br>\tApple Music 之前也订阅过，但是遇到过两次耳机爆音以及 appstore 切换 id 会丢失资料库，这两个点受不了。<br>话说你们现在都订阅着什么 App ？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917057\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f8df66b7082e3bc3b25c68a9a8c5877?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"997sama\" data-uid=\"791675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/997sama\">997sama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:46:28 +08:00\">23h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>打算上 apple music 。网易云不打算用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917124\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ccb21acafc718fa9576019530297253?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dgmgso\" data-uid=\"597829\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dgmgso\">dgmgso</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:56:18 +08:00\">23h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有群晖之后都是自建 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ee8Lq7H.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ee8Lq7H.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>之前是网易云会员，后来不想续了到处找盗版听。再后来不停了。再后来买了群晖自建</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917127\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2e0/b2cf/175571_normal.png?m=1761316400\" alt=\"uqf0663\" data-uid=\"175571\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/uqf0663\">uqf0663</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:56:58 +08:00\">23h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我已经很长时间只在 B 站搜关键词 “wav 合集” 然后看列表哪个顺眼进去听哪个了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917139\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d2d0/4b36/312675_normal.png?m=1715420430\" alt=\"FabricPath\" data-uid=\"312675\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/FabricPath\">FabricPath</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:59:18 +08:00\">22h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>apple music<br>家庭组 17 块钱 6 个人用</p><p>我是点进去就开始放每周的推荐歌单，推荐啥听啥，不挑。对各种明星也没有特别偏好，纯听歌。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917149\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/06cd3b8f55457eda1ccc4b4640fffbfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ffalex\" data-uid=\"46426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ffalex\">ffalex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:00:58 +08:00\">22h 57m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>手机本地音乐 uapp 播放，流媒体用 YT Music 。<br>电脑只听本地的，主要听 ost 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917161\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/06cd3b8f55457eda1ccc4b4640fffbfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ffalex\" data-uid=\"46426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ffalex\">ffalex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:02:27 +08:00\">22h 55m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这一说，我才想起来网易云的续费好像一直忘关了😅</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917163\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd34/b9c8/107662_normal.png?m=1715333637\" alt=\"Sosocould\" data-uid=\"107662\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sosocould\">Sosocould</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:02:42 +08:00\">22h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>spotify ，曲库全，对 IP 友好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917165\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:02:57 +08:00\">22h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Spotify, 一个月 68HKD</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917167\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ee5b2fa7c3f218c984d0b68321ac71e7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bobryjosin\" data-uid=\"576594\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bobryjosin\">bobryjosin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:03:09 +08:00\">22h 54m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>Spotify 的无损一般，没 AM 好，不插有线耳机，纯无线 aac 编码质量开到高往上就没区别了，至少我听不出来，现在开的新区个人 Spotify 订阅。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917179\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/911c/55d2/626138_normal.png?m=1783565384\" alt=\"fionasit007\" data-uid=\"626138\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fionasit007\">fionasit007</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:05:24 +08:00\">22h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>qq 音乐，主要是习惯（小学就再用）和曲库（ Spotify 几年前用过感觉华语还是差点），而且我一般用 pc 听没有广告这些烦恼</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917225\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cdca/41db/41900_normal.png?m=1711607036\" alt=\"icanfork\" data-uid=\"41900\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icanfork\">icanfork</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:14:15 +08:00\">22h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jsomin\">jsomin</a> 对，曲库很全，然后也订阅价格也便宜。就是交互贼恶心，我都是 VIP 用户了，听个歌要弹 2 次音质升级“推广”抽屉或者弹窗。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917321\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5a8829826e1b0e022e695bd7f2b05452?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuhuij\" data-uid=\"416499\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuhuij\">yuhuij</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:28:35 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>qq 音乐，一个月 6.8</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917326\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c447/3a8d/623854_normal.png?m=1778490203\" alt=\"wuxie01\" data-uid=\"623854\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wuxie01\">wuxie01</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:28:58 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>波点音乐 qq 音乐的 lite 版本 感觉还可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917342\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c1a0/d204/694202_normal.png?m=1784087290\" alt=\"systemGuest\" data-uid=\"694202\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/systemGuest\">systemGuest</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:30:55 +08:00\">22h 27m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>汽水音乐吧，抖音的大数据推荐挺牛的，听歌也可以上你上瘾。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917407\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7edc/b62f/747709_normal.png?m=1776396021\" alt=\"MokeSher\" data-uid=\"747709\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MokeSher\">MokeSher</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:41:21 +08:00\">22h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直用免费的杜比大喇叭插件，网易云音源接口替换</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917882\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/df91d14c373afd17e6c7b5a00d487db4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Dillan\" data-uid=\"550284\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Dillan\">Dillan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 17:57:59 +08:00\">21h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>YouTube Music <br>Premium 送的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917889\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9424f7e30b3c76cc75d502031bbfdb57?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"oudwwv\" data-uid=\"691834\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oudwwv\">oudwwv</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 17:59:14 +08:00\">20h 58m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>QQ 音乐，看 5 秒广告可以免费听 30 分钟</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917988\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a6e19ea8fd964400e7cb73fcafa796d5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ingram22mb30\" data-uid=\"446618\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ingram22mb30\">ingram22mb30</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 18:28:09 +08:00\">20h 29m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>本地音乐，没有突然变成 vip 专享的顾虑！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918041\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/71d4/5261/215205_normal.png?m=1785026453\" alt=\"dif\" data-uid=\"215205\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dif\">dif</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 18:47:31 +08:00\">20h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我从 QQ 音乐换网易云（自己有 88VIP ）了，目前两个人一起用（消费降级），支持五个设备也够用了，谁有谁的歌单，会定期备份歌单（吵架容易把歌单给我删了。。。）。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918195\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2d70f05d82ea8fea90808106c78de3a5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wshjdx\" data-uid=\"415766\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wshjdx\">wshjdx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 20:10:30 +08:00\">18h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>roon+tidal</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918217\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8abf/c6fb/478454_normal.png?m=1690878196\" alt=\"z1645444\" data-uid=\"478454\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/z1645444\">z1645444</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 20:27:23 +08:00\">18h 30m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>Spotify</p><p>- 官方按 genre 分的 playlist 维护得非常